

     Context

     Service NSW needs a single-box search experience with < 100ms P95 latency, delivering both keyword autocomplete and direct Q&A before the user hits Enter. Data is aggregated (not owned), Azure AI Search is the
      existing engine, and a High Frequency Search (HFS) list of the top 1,000 queries is available as an in-memory intercept layer. The Admin Key must never reach the frontend.

