     Recommendation: Cloudflare Workers
     - V8 isolates mean no container spin-up; cold start is effectively zero
     - Runs at the edge PoP nearest the user (critical for Sydney-concentrated government traffic)
     - Workers KV provides cheap persistent storage to warm the HFS Trie across deployments
     - Node.js-compatible; fetch() to Azure AI Search works natively
     - Limitation: Adds a non-Azure dependency; requires Cloudflare account management

     Azure Functions Premium (if Azure-only required)
     - Pre-warmed instances fully eliminate cold starts
     - HFS Trie lives in module-level memory (persists across invocations within the same instance)
     - Limitation: Always-on cost; single-region unless paired with Azure Front Door (~$35/month extra); more operational overhead

