     ---
     Index Schema (summary — for later implementation)

     - Fields: id, title, url, body_excerpt, content_type, hfs_boost_score, keywords[]
     - Semantic configuration: title as title field, body_excerpt as content field
     - Suggester: over title + keywords[]
     - Scoring profile: boost hfs_boost_score to surface high-frequency content

     ---
     Verification (post-build)

     1. Load test with k6: ramp to 500 RPS, assert P95 < 100 ms
     2. Disable Azure (simulate timeout), confirm HFS fallback returns within 5 ms
     3. Test question vs keyword intent routing with 20 representative queries
     4. Confirm Admin Key is absent from all browser network requests
     5. Check Workers KV / function memory is warmed on cold boot with HFS list

