  Cloudflare Workers is the optimal fit: V8 isolates give genuinely zero cold starts, Workers KV stores the HFS list across deployments, and it runs at the edge PoP nearest Sydney users. The only trade-off is a
  non-Azure dependency. If Azure-only is a hard constraint, use Functions Premium with Azure Front Door (~$35/month) for edge distribution.

